{"plain_text_response":"BEGIN UNTRUSTED WEB CONTENT [L0ZkdnBH6inSNDcJ]\nSource: https://example.org/raven2\nRetrieved: 2026-08-28T23:11:57Z\nContent SHA-256: 3907c877bd28540d0a130f54619803be02673c0550fa642b4b17d5a8347a8f5d\nStart Index: 0\nReturned Characters: 306\nNext Start Index: end\nPossibly Truncated: no\nVulkan decode on Raven2. The Qwen3.8-4B distill at Q4_K_M decodes at 3.07 tokens per second with every layer on the Vulkan device. The two Vega compute units and the two Zen+ cores draw on one DDR4-2133 controller, so a split placement adds synchronization without adding bandwidth. FIXTURE-PAGE-RAVEN2-END\nEND UNTRUSTED WEB CONTENT [L0ZkdnBH6inSNDcJ]"}